    "id": 1,
    "title": "Two Sum",
    "difficulty": "Easy",
    "accept_rate": 55.2,
    "tags": [
      "Array",
      "Hash Map"
    ],
    "description": "## 题目\n\n给定一个整数数组 `nums` 和一个目标值 `target`，返回 `nums` 中和为 `target` 的两个数的**索引**（下标从 0 开始）。\n\n每个输入只保证一个答案，且同一元素不能使用两次。\n\n## 示例\n\n**输入:** `nums = [2,7,11,15], target = 9`\n**输出:** `[0,1]`  // 因为 nums[0] + nums[1] == 2 + 7 == 9\n",
    "signature": "def solve(nums: list[int], target: int) -> list[int]:",
    "test_cases": [
      {
        "input": {
          "nums": [
            2,
            7,
            11,
            15
          ],
          "target": 9
        },
        "expected": [
          0,
          1
        ]
      }
    ],
    "hidden_tests": [
      {
        "input": {
          "nums": [
            3,
            2,
            4
          ],
          "target": 6
        },
        "expected": [
          1,
          2
        ]
      },
      {
        "input": {
          "nums": [
            3,
            3
          ],
          "target": 6
        },
        "expected": [
          0,
          1
        ]
      },
      {
        "input": {
          "nums": [
            1,
            2,
            3,
            4,
            5
          ],
          "target": 9
        },
        "expected": [
          3,
          4
        ]
      },
      {
        "input": {
          "nums": [
            0,
            4,
            3,
            0
          ],
          "target": 0
        },
        "expected": [
          0,
          3
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
